exports[`SettingsDialog > CodeMode setting > offers localized modes and shows the remote default when unset in 'en' 1`] = `
" Settings ·  User Settings   Project Settings
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Stored in ~/.qwen/settings.json. Lower priority than Project settings.
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  codeMode.mode
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ❯ Code Mode                  Only
    Respond to Shell Commands  false
    Default Permission Mode    Default
    AGENTS.md Excludes

 Requires service availability. Default inherits local or remote settings; Off disables
 CodeMode; On keeps direct tools; Only routes supported tools through scripts.

 Tab/←→ switch · ↑↓ navigate · Enter toggle · Esc back
"
`;

exports[`SettingsDialog > CodeMode setting > offers localized modes and shows the remote default when unset in 'zh-CN' 1`] = `
" 设置 ·  用户设置   项目设置
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 存储于 ~/.qwen/settings.json。优先级低于项目设置。
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  codeMode.mode
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ❯ Code Mode     仅 CodeMode

 受服务端总开关控制。默认沿用本地或远端设置；关闭停用，开启保留直接调用，仅 CodeMode
 通过脚本调用支持的工具。重启后生效。

 Tab/←→ 切换 · ↑↓ 导航 · Enter 切换 · Esc 返回
"
`;

